    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "d2gyuib",
      "content": "<strong>UNIT 6 — CURRENT AFFAIRS &amp; ECONOMY</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "88sgz7u",
      "content": "This unit covers important current affairs themes relevant to PSU exam GK sections. Topics include recent government policy, major PSU developments, international events, science &amp; technology, awards &amp; recognition, and important economic indicators."
    },
    {
